# cfl_variant Struct Definition

The struct contains a type indicator, size, two flag bytes, and a data union:

```c
struct cfl_variant {
    int type;
    size_t size;
    uint8_t referenced;
    uint8_t owned;
    union {
        cfl_sds_t as_string;
        cfl_sds_t as_bytes;
        unsigned int as_bool;
        int64_t as_int64;
